{"4579910": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Food for Fairies", "steam_appid": 4579910, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up from your slumber to realize summer is about to pass, and you’re tasked to prepare a feast to celebrate the changing seasons. Talk to your other fairy friends and gather ingredients to suit their dinner preferences in this little point &amp; click game! Take your time, and enjoy the lingering warmth in the forest atmosphere. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Point &amp; click structure, investigate various forest environments and search for food ingredients suited for delicious fairy-sized meals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soak in the nature with a calm atmosphere, maybe even pause for a while to relax with it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There’s fairies in it! And you can talk to them! In fact, you're playing as one.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Controls are as follows: Left mouse button - Click to move around the maps and investigate objects Esc - Bring up menu</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579910/extras/5fb0365dac1309c7bcd40f27a55ac299.poster.avif?t=1786097527\" width=200 height=359 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579910/extras/5fb0365dac1309c7bcd40f27a55ac299.webm?t=1786097527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up from your slumber to realize summer is about to pass, and you’re tasked to prepare a feast to celebrate the changing seasons. Talk to your other fairy friends and gather ingredients to suit their dinner preferences in this little point &amp; click game! Take your time, and enjoy the lingering warmth in the forest atmosphere. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Point &amp; click structure, investigate various forest environments and search for food ingredients suited for delicious fairy-sized meals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soak in the nature with a calm atmosphere, maybe even pause for a while to relax with it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There’s fairies in it! And you can talk to them! In fact, you're playing as one.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Controls are as follows: Left mouse button - Click to move around the maps and investigate objects Esc - Bring up menu</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579910/extras/5fb0365dac1309c7bcd40f27a55ac299.poster.avif?t=1786097527\" width=200 height=359 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579910/extras/5fb0365dac1309c7bcd40f27a55ac299.webm?t=1786097527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Food for Fairies is a small point and click adventure, where you go forth as a diminutive fairy in preparation for a dinner party celebrating the end of summer.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579910/5dcc89f801307f0c6594d27954407b1150bd9ff6/header.jpg?t=1786097527", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579910/95243c9ba829fa52d9260340c1cdcb4333a4bf79/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786097527", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579910/95243c9ba829fa52d9260340c1cdcb4333a4bf79/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786097527", "website": "https://foodforfairies.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><